adherence (ADH). After 6 months of follow-up, results demonstrated no significant differences among groups in HbA1c.    
KNOW and TEAM scores improved slightly in the ED and ED + TCM groups, but no statistically significant differences were 
found among the three groups. Significant improvement in ADH scores among ED + TCM groups was reported when compared    
